WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:04,860
Jin Yi

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,680
What's wrong with your feet? It's okay

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,320
I accidentally sprained myself yesterday

4
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:12,360
Do you want someone to help you down? No, I can do it myself. You guys can do your work.

5
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,020
His feet are like this

6
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,180
Come down alone

7
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,620
Anyone who cares and asks will do it

8
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,420
But only Miko

9
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:22,310
Do you need help? Me

10
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,010
The police box is so heavy

11
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:25,450
The dormitory is on the seventh floor

12
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,270
Only Miko will really help me with things

13
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,030
Jiang Muye is such a field dog

14
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:39,050
It doesn't matter if you want it or not, but Miko cannot lose the system host.

15
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:41,740
May I ask if you want to upgrade?

16
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,460
The system is exchanging charm values

17
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,580
Congratulations on being upgraded to five-star maid

18
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:47,900
Lose 20 pounds by swapping

19
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:51,600
Congratulations to the host on the successful beauty treatment

20
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:57,710
Fortunately this one is closed

21
00:00:57,990 --> 00:00:59,350
Why isn't it counted among the maids?

22
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:05,840
The prettier one? Miko, have you stayed with Xiaomuye?

23
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,920
You rolled down the mountain yesterday
